{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Pass law to require authorities to meet needs of people with Edwards' syndrome",
        "additional_details": "Edwards\u202f/\u202fTrisomy\u202f18 \u2014 including mosaic \u2014 is lifelong, complex & multi system, but no legal duty like Down\u2019s Syndrome Act\u202f2022. Often wrongly called \u201cshort term\u201d, leading to unsafe early discharge from therapies & paediatrics, no named neurodisability lead & preventable harm. Support should follow need, not diagnosis prevalence. Equal law = equal safe, joined up care.",
        "background": "Give Edwards\u202f/\u202fTrisomy\u202f18 \u2014 including mosaic forms \u2014 same legal recognition & guaranteed NHS care pathways as Down\u2019s Syndrome Act\u202f2022. End unfair, unsafe gaps: no automatic discharge; ensure named neuro disability leads & joined up lifelong care based on need, not diagnosis name.",
